#: ../../howto/index.rst:2 964daef0430247638e312fbf336f16cc
msgid "How-to guides"
msgstr "操作指南"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:4 0159d97ecf0f4443a098695428b13ac6
msgid ""
"Choose the guide for the outcome you need, then follow its safety and "
"response steps before copying an example:"
msgstr "请选择与你的目标对应的指南，并在复制示例前遵循其中的安全与响应处理步骤："

#: ../../howto/index.rst:7 62a7ed2136f14025af85ac1d9cf17a3e
msgid ":doc:`info-queries` covers credential-free market and account reads."
msgstr ":doc:`info-queries` 介绍无需凭证的市场与账户查询。"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:8 018cefa898284cfa910ebc23277a91a8
msgid ":doc:`markets` explains canonical coin names and metadata-derived IDs."
msgstr ":doc:`markets` 说明规范 coin 名称和由元数据派生的 ID。"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:9 3ddeb33e16204e258a9f8d2bca3ed9cd
msgid ""
":doc:`orders` covers order placement, triggers, TP/SL, TWAP, "
"modification, cancellation, and closing."
msgstr ":doc:`orders` 介绍下单、触发器、TP/SL、TWAP、修改、取消和平仓。"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:11 5bd69212b0bc49fd9f901eeb18b658c8
msgid ""
":doc:`routing` explains main accounts, API wallets, subaccounts, vaults, "
"and endpoint trust boundaries."
msgstr ":doc:`routing` 说明 main account、API wallet、subaccount、vault 与端点信任边界。"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:13 049efede22054ccbbb7c2f135c7e3454
msgid ""
":doc:`transfers-administration` covers fund-moving operations with "
"explicit signed-action examples, plus paid, administrative, outcome, and "
"validator actions."
msgstr ""
":doc:`transfers-administration` 介绍带有明确签名操作示例的资金转移，以及付费、管理、outcome "
"和验证者操作。"

#: ../../howto/index.rst:16 91f467b50d26400090b0911f7f0724d3
msgid ""
":doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation` covers sessions, errors, nonce ownership,"
" and ambiguous signed outcomes."
msgstr ":doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation` 介绍会话、错误、nonce 所有权以及不确定的签名结果。"

#~ msgid "These guides group public operations by workflow:"
#~ msgstr "这些指南按工作流归类公开操作："
